* CE Polarized Capacitor
*
* SPICE (Simulation Program with Integrated Circuit Emphasis)
* SUBCIRCUIT
*
* C = Capacitance  (C1)
* ESL = Equivalent Series Inductance (L1)
* IR = Insulation Resistance (R2)
* ESR = Equivalent Series Resistance (R1)
* ELR = Equivalent Inductive Resistance (R3)
*
* Connections:
*                 +
*                 |  -
*                 |  |
